        <Summary xml:lang="en">Pytest plugin that allows to customize the test execution order</Summary>
        <Description xml:lang="en">Pytest plugin that allows you to customize the order in which your tests are run. It uses the marker order that defines when a specific test shall run, either by using an ordinal number, or by specifying the relationship to other tests.
</Description>
